Z||000001||Tom88gt||12-21-2000||10:18 PM||||Sounds like a thrown connecting rod.  Could be a bent push rod.  Anyway, if you have a severe internal knocking, something broke and your engine is trashed.  Time for a new engine.  This is a blessing in disguise as you now have the perfect opportunity to move up to a bigger engine.||||reg||1
