Z||000006||Tom88gt||12-21-2000||11:11 PM||||You can probably get a used one from a junkyard for a couple hundred.  Rebuilts from auto parts stores are probably about 2 grand.  A few hundred gets you a used 3.1/3.4.  Non 60 degree engines cost about the same but install gets costly and complicated.  Opinions are like assholes, everyone's got one.  But only you can decide what new engine is right for you ans your budget.  2.8 Junkyard is the cheapest.  I'm assuming you have a V-6.  L-4 is not worth the effort or $ to replace.||||reg||1
