Z||000010||StuGood||12-22-2000||05:37 PM||||This probably won't help much, but whenever I have to put money into one of my vehicles, I talk to people with relatively new cars.  Whenever they start talking about their payments/ taxes/ tags/ repair costs, I suddenly feel much better about sinking a few hundred into mine  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">.  My "car payments" happen every now and then... theirs continue month after month... for years.<BR>   <BR>Needless to say, don't rub their noses in it, or brag about how little your expenses are - the idea is to make yourself feel better, not make them feel bad  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  ||||reg||1
